Package: conpyro
Type: Package
Title: Conifer Pyrometrics Fire Behaviour Modelling System
Version: 0.2.0
Description: Implements the Conifer Pyrometrics (ConPyro) fire behaviour
    modelling system introduced by Perrakis et al. (2020). Calculates fuel
    moisture, crown fire occurrence probability, crowning thresholds, and
    surface and crown fire rates of spread from weather and stand attributes.
    Includes crown fire occurrence models developed by Perrakis et al. (2023)
    <https://doi.org/10.1071/WF23074> and surface fire spread models developed
    by Perrakis et al. (2026) <https://doi.org/10.3390/fire9070302>. See the 
    package documentation for full references and model applicability.
